From d1d277c3112352228d48bb9a7b083efeff77d6ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:53:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Legendary gear: Dragon Shards, Super Dragon Balls, Legend
 Orbs and the Legendsmith

Super equipment can be forged into Legendary gear at the Legendsmith (Twin City),
which raises that item's attack, defense, magic attack, magic defense and HP by 20%.
Super Dragon Ball = 10 Dragon Balls (30% forge chance); Legend Orb = 3 Super Dragon
Balls + 7 Dragon Shards (always succeeds). Bosses drop Dragon Shards.

Adds the Items.Legendary column (migration LegendaryItems) and legendary.sql for
existing databases.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012QZ2EofieBFmMsHF9Yardw
